        <summary>The media type (audio, video, image, document, playlist or subtitle) of the file, or 0 for not a media file.</summary>
        <remarks>
          <para>The media type (audio, video, image, document, playlist or subtitle) of the file, or 0 for not a media file. This constant represents a column name that can be used with a ContentProvider through a ContentValues or Cursor object. The values stored in this column are Cursor#FIELD_TYPE_INTEGER.</para>
