        <summary>The index of the parent directory of the file.</summary>
        <remarks>
          <para>The index of the parent directory of the file. This constant represents a column name that can be used with a ContentProvider through a ContentValues or Cursor object. The values stored in this column are Cursor#FIELD_TYPE_INTEGER, and are read-only and cannot be mutated.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/provider/MediaStore.Files.FileColumns#PARENT" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.provider.MediaStore.Files.FileColumns.PARENT</code>.</a></format></para>
